{% comment %}
  The home page is all blocks and no article furniture — the hero slider runs
  full-bleed straight under the header, so there is no centred title to push it
  down the page. Everything below comes from the block region.

  The page still needs exactly one real <h1> (every hero slide heading below
  is an <h2>, or aria-hidden entirely bar the first slide) — a visually-hidden
  one carrying the same text as the page <title> gives search engines and
  screen readers a real heading without disturbing the full-bleed hero design.
{% endcomment %}
<h1 class="visually-hidden">{{ site.name | escape }}{% if site.tagline %} — {{ site.tagline | escape }}{% endif %}</h1>
{% region 'content' %}
